    {
      "id": "156:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36919:36921"
    },
    {
      "id": "156:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "跟着这样一个怪人深入森林太危险了。你转身试着找到回去的路。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36921:36952"
    },
    {
      "id": "156:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次导航检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36952:36963"
    },
    {
      "id": "156:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 157。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36963:36979"
    },
    {
      "id": "156:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 159。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36979:36995"
    },
    {
      "id": "156:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，而你希望孤注一掷，你可以进行第二次检定；后果是在寒夜中迷路更长时间：\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36995:37038"
    },
    {
      "id": "156:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果孤注一掷成功，转到 157。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:37038:37056"
    },
    {
      "id": "156:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果孤注一掷失败，转到 162。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:37056:37074"
    }
  ]
}
